get.description:
If a session exists for the given account ID and agent ID (both extracted from the JWT, aid and uid, respectively),
  - the agent nonce (encrypted with an the RSA public key (RSA public-private key pair generated when creating the session)) is returned;
  - otherwise a Not Found is thrown
